361
00:22:17,010 --> 00:22:19,380
Do not worry about it. I will keep looking into it myself.

362
00:22:20,710 --> 00:22:22,050
This is my problem.

363
00:22:23,580 --> 00:22:24,850
Let me know if you find anything.

364
00:22:25,580 --> 00:22:27,520
Do not try to act tough all by yourself.

365
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:35,690
Are you going to...

366
00:22:36,290 --> 00:22:37,290
