367
00:22:38,660 --> 00:22:39,660
Where else?

368
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:48,710
Here.

369
00:23:08,730 --> 00:23:10,730
I think staying at the hospital was a good idea.

370
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:14,300
CEO Park will handle it well.

371
00:23:15,870 --> 00:23:16,870
Yes.

372
00:23:17,470 --> 00:23:19,170
