373
00:23:19,740 --> 00:23:21,340
I guess they did not see you pass out earlier.

374
00:23:22,070 --> 00:23:23,070
Yes.

375
00:23:27,980 --> 00:23:30,010
- I am sorry. - Yes.

376
00:23:32,380 --> 00:23:33,380
No.

377
00:23:34,350 --> 00:23:35,350
For what?

378
00:23:36,190 --> 00:23:37,320
Instead of comforting you,

379
00:23:38,660 --> 00:23:40,160
I tried to treat you.

380
00:23:43,090 --> 00:23:45,360
I wanted to do something for you too, but...

381
00:23:47,030 --> 00:23:48,130
I guess I am...

382
00:23:49,370 --> 00:23:50,970
