398
00:25:27,430 --> 00:25:28,570
Will you bring her back?

399
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:31,940
Please give me some time. Let's leave her be for now,

400
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,700
- and I will find a way... - Do that.

401
00:25:36,340 --> 00:25:37,340
Excuse me?

402
00:25:43,910 --> 00:25:47,180
Are they cleaning the bathroom or not?

403
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:50,020
It stinks. I really want to go home.

404
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:54,620
