407
00:26:05,770 --> 00:26:08,440
Then it will heal on its own. You will be fully recovered.

408
00:26:09,540 --> 00:26:11,440
Is it really because of this?

409
00:26:13,180 --> 00:26:14,510
No way.

410
00:26:26,060 --> 00:26:27,060
Should I...

411
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:28,960
try it?

412
00:27:15,340 --> 00:27:16,740
That feels good.

413
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:20,240
- Hey, what are you doing here? - No, no, let's sleep.

414
00:27:20,710 --> 00:27:22,050
I always sleep on the floor at home anyway.

415
00:27:22,110 --> 00:27:24,010
- It is so cool. - Get up.

416
00:27:24,180 --> 00:27:25,220
Do not touch me.

417
00:27:26,180 --> 00:27:27,420
No. Let's sleep.

418
00:27:30,050 --> 00:27:31,050
What the...

419
00:27:42,870 --> 00:27:44,530
(Woori Hospital)

420
00:28:24,710 --> 00:28:25,710
What are you doing right now?

421
00:28:26,140 --> 00:28:27,140
You startled me...

422
00:28:27,910 --> 00:28:30,310
Are you preparing to run away this early in the morning?

423
00:28:30,680 --> 00:28:33,580
I need some free time too.

424
00:28:34,250 --> 00:28:35,950
Faking an illness was not enough,

425
00:28:36,020 --> 00:28:38,590
now you dream of sneaking out behind your agency's back?

426
00:28:38,620 --> 00:28:40,720
Why not just go ahead and pull it right out?

427
00:28:40,790 --> 00:28:42,030
Others seem to pull them out just fine.

428
00:28:42,090 --> 00:28:43,660
That only happens in dramas.

429
00:28:43,730 --> 00:28:46,230
The needle is this huge, so how can I pull it out in one go?

430
00:28:46,300 --> 00:28:50,100
If you do that in real life, blood will squirt everywhere. Gosh.

431
00:28:50,170 --> 00:28:51,600
Stop watching so many dramas. Seriously.

432
00:28:53,040 --> 00:28:55,140
You know what? Watch a lot of them.

433
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:57,710
Watch them often. Keep watching them.

434
00:29:10,720 --> 00:29:11,720
Come here.

435
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:15,630
I guess you need a day like this.

436
00:29:16,430 --> 00:29:18,060
A day for Tae Bong to breathe.

437
00:29:23,030 --> 00:29:24,030
Why?

438
00:29:24,630 --> 00:29:25,800
I want to use that today.

439
00:29:27,500 --> 00:29:29,210
The birthday present you gave me,

440
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:32,040
