441
00:29:38,450 --> 00:29:41,750
Why are you doing this to me? What are you saying?

442
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:45,220
All the words you said today up to the sky

443
00:29:45,860 --> 00:29:47,220
The words I could never say

444
00:29:47,460 --> 00:29:48,560
Darn it.

445
00:29:48,860 --> 00:29:50,730
You have been listening to this song all this time?

446
00:29:52,430 --> 00:29:55,230
This little thing, is exactly your voice, you know?

447
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:57,230
I cannot live without it now.

448
00:29:58,230 --> 00:29:59,240
It is not even a big deal.

449
00:29:59,770 --> 00:30:00,840
But seriously, where are we going?

450
00:30:00,900 --> 00:30:02,270
You were searching for a long time earlier.

451
00:30:03,170 --> 00:30:04,240
You will see when we get there.

452
00:30:11,650 --> 00:30:14,250
Things are working out so smoothly.

453
00:30:14,320 --> 00:30:15,320
After the beep...

454
00:30:15,390 --> 00:30:16,390
If it goes like this,

455
00:30:17,090 --> 00:30:20,020
the Chairman I saw yesterday will definitely...

456
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:22,760
, seriously. He even turned off his phone.

457
00:30:22,830 --> 00:30:25,260
This is driving me crazy. That girl Cha Hong Du...

458
00:30:25,460 --> 00:30:29,130
- is going to be all over him... - How did I find that out?

459
00:30:29,530 --> 00:30:30,670
Find out what?

460
00:30:31,300 --> 00:30:34,470
What do you mean, what? I found out who the father is.

461
00:30:35,510 --> 00:30:36,510
Hey, Su Dong,

462
00:30:36,570 --> 00:30:37,870
do you have a Housing Subscription Account?

463
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:40,640
No. Someone pays me peanuts for a salary.

464
00:30:41,310 --> 00:30:42,750
I have a Housing Subscription Account.

465
00:30:43,380 --> 00:30:45,420
Actually, I think I have a pension plan too.

466
00:30:56,730 --> 00:30:58,760
Is this where you wanted to come? Why?

467
00:30:58,900 --> 00:31:01,430
- Why? - You will find out later.

468
00:31:03,670 --> 00:31:05,030
What exactly is here...

469
00:31:07,940 --> 00:31:09,410
It is a river.

470
00:31:21,680 --> 00:31:23,650
If you fall in, I am not fishing you out.

471
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:25,960
I am good at swimming...

472
00:31:27,620 --> 00:31:28,630
Am I?

473
00:31:29,660 --> 00:31:31,730
I do not know, I do not remember that.

474
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:41,240
It is a swing.

475
00:31:42,140 --> 00:31:44,510
- Tae Bong, push me. - Push what.

476
00:31:44,570 --> 00:31:46,140
Hurry. Push me.

477
00:31:46,210 --> 00:31:48,040
- Darn it... - Hurry.

478
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:49,780
Seriously...

479
00:31:50,980 --> 00:31:52,380
- I am pushing you. - Yes.

480
00:31:52,580 --> 00:31:53,580
One.

481
00:31:56,820 --> 00:31:58,250
Harder.

482
00:32:02,190 --> 00:32:03,560
Harder.

483
00:32:05,530 --> 00:32:06,830
Even harder.

484
00:32:09,600 --> 00:32:10,830
This guy, seriously.

485
00:32:11,370 --> 00:32:12,370
Hey.

486
00:32:30,950 --> 00:32:34,320
- Tae Bong, take a picture of me. - No.

487
00:32:34,390 --> 00:32:36,060
Hurry!

488
00:32:36,530 --> 00:32:38,230
Seriously...

489
00:32:39,930 --> 00:32:40,930
Take it.

490
00:32:41,330 --> 00:32:42,330
I am taking it.

491
00:32:42,930 --> 00:32:44,230
One, two, three.

492
00:32:47,100 --> 00:32:48,100
Check it.

493
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:55,110
You jerk.

494
00:32:56,880 --> 00:32:57,880
Hey.

495
00:33:01,020 --> 00:33:02,020
Let us go.

496
00:33:08,390 --> 00:33:09,390
Sir.

497
00:33:09,790 --> 00:33:12,360
- Did you catch a lot? - Well, yes and no.

498
00:33:12,430 --> 00:33:13,430
I caught a ton.

499
00:33:15,830 --> 00:33:16,930
Do not talk to him.

500
00:33:17,230 --> 00:33:18,940
It will be exhausting if he recognises me...

501
00:33:20,070 --> 00:33:21,070
You.

502
00:33:24,240 --> 00:33:26,480
Why did you not come to my second grandchild's wedding?

503
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:27,680
Excuse me?

504
00:33:27,740 --> 00:33:29,110
You are not coming to the third one either, right?

505
00:33:29,310 --> 00:33:33,250
Then I am cutting ties with all of you. Do you understand?

506
00:33:34,950 --> 00:33:36,990
Why would I...

507
00:33:37,520 --> 00:33:39,120
Excuse me...

508
00:33:39,190 --> 00:33:41,660
Are you not the village head's grandson?

509
00:33:42,090 --> 00:33:45,630
You look very familiar. Well, never mind if you are not.

510
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:50,230
I want to try it too.

511
00:33:50,700 --> 00:33:52,170
Sure. Give it a try.

512
00:33:53,570 --> 00:33:54,900
No, I am...

513
00:33:54,970 --> 00:33:55,970
Keep up the good work.

514
00:34:02,210 --> 00:34:04,250
No. Do not even think about it.

515
00:34:08,850 --> 00:34:11,720
Today, I will definitely catch one.

516
00:34:12,020 --> 00:34:13,220
Let us hurry up and go.

517
00:34:16,190 --> 00:34:17,960
- I caught one. - Where?

518
00:34:18,030 --> 00:34:19,030
There.

519
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:21,800
- Wait a minute. - Where?

520
00:34:25,030 --> 00:34:26,500
Stop messing around, Tae Bong.

521
00:34:26,570 --> 00:34:29,240
- I am serious... - Really?

522
00:34:29,610 --> 00:34:30,670
You are the one who did it.

523
00:35:00,170 --> 00:35:01,840
For the VIPs who attended,

524
00:35:01,900 --> 00:35:03,570
