526
00:35:05,240 --> 00:35:07,180
We were inadequate in our facility inspection.

527
00:35:07,240 --> 00:35:08,240
I apologize.

528
00:35:23,090 --> 00:35:25,930
Why did he look at Hong Du like that back then?

529
00:35:29,970 --> 00:35:31,030
Just a moment ago,

530
00:35:31,100 --> 00:35:33,000
