531
00:35:37,140 --> 00:35:38,170
We will continue this later.

532
00:35:38,640 --> 00:35:39,640
Yes, sir.

533
00:35:50,550 --> 00:35:51,620
London.

534
00:35:52,990 --> 00:35:54,990
Is that person finally coming?

535
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:58,230
When that person returns this time,

536
00:35:58,290 --> 00:36:00,230
