This is your chance to turn your life around.

803
00:56:13,270 --> 00:56:16,110
- You are teaching her great things. - Now, please show them in.

804
00:56:17,480 --> 00:56:18,480
Right this way.

805
00:56:23,750 --> 00:56:25,390
I can understand Hong Du,

806
00:56:26,490 --> 00:56:28,760
but why is the Chairman doing this to his own daughter...

807
00:56:30,830 --> 00:56:31,830
There is something going on.

808
00:56:35,800 --> 00:56:38,630
- Is the Chairman inside? - He went home earlier.

809
00:56:39,770 --> 00:56:41,340
I had an appointment with him at six o'clock.

810
00:56:41,400 --> 00:56:43,200
He said he will not be coming back today,

811
00:56:43,400 --> 00:56:44,410
so please come back tomorrow.

812
00:56:45,040 --> 00:56:46,040
Okay.

813
00:56:50,750 --> 00:56:51,750
Please let him know.

814
00:56:55,620 --> 00:56:56,620
Well...

815
00:56:56,990 --> 00:57:00,390
He asked Manager Nam Goong to wait in the reception room.

816
00:57:01,820 --> 00:57:04,360
Did you not just say he went home and would not be coming back?

817
00:57:04,730 --> 00:57:05,730
No...

818
00:57:06,800 --> 00:57:07,800
It is just...

819
00:57:16,540 --> 00:57:17,740
Young lady, where are you right now?

820
00:57:19,210 --> 00:57:20,210
Young lady?

821
00:57:21,710 --> 00:57:22,710
At the Chairman's house?

822
00:57:23,180 --> 00:57:25,080
Why did you not report the young lady's whereabouts.

823
00:57:37,990 --> 00:57:39,990
I was suddenly invited to the house of a chairman...

824
00:57:40,060 --> 00:57:41,860
who is a fan of Tae Bong.

825
00:57:42,000 --> 00:57:45,170
I am sorry I cannot make it to our dinner tonight, Han Jung Woo.

826
00:58:07,590 --> 00:58:10,190
Tae Bong, I scanned the place on my way in,

827
00:58:10,460 --> 00:58:12,060
and there is not a single BK item here.

828
00:58:12,430 --> 00:58:13,430
You can relax.

829
00:58:22,970 --> 00:58:23,970
Why?

830
00:58:25,240 --> 00:58:27,210
I was supposed to have dinner with Han Jung Woo tonight,

831
00:58:27,280 --> 00:58:28,280
but I completely forgot.

832
00:58:29,140 --> 00:58:30,510
Why are you having dinner with him?

833
00:58:30,750 --> 00:58:33,080
This is an official schedule too. It is your job.

834
00:58:33,150 --> 00:58:34,150
I know.

835
00:58:38,020 --> 00:58:41,660
I had them prepare this with care, so please eat up. Now, please sit.

836
00:58:43,790 --> 00:58:46,190
- Thank you for the meal, Chairman. - Yes.

837
00:58:46,260 --> 00:58:49,760
It is bulgogi. Bulgogi. It is my absolute favourite.

838
00:58:50,330 --> 00:58:52,270
- Is it? - Yes.

839
00:58:52,430 --> 00:58:54,300
Is it okay if I eat until I burst today?

840
00:58:54,570 --> 00:58:57,110
I have never been to a rich house or had food like this before.

841
00:58:57,270 --> 00:58:58,670
What do you mean this is your first time?

842
00:58:58,770 --> 00:58:59,770
My house where you sleep,

843
00:58:59,840 --> 00:59:01,840
your room is full of nice things like this.

844
00:59:05,410 --> 00:59:07,320
No, I mean...

845
00:59:07,720 --> 00:59:10,290
People might think I am starving you.

846
00:59:11,350 --> 00:59:12,650
Chew what is in your mouth before you speak,

847
00:59:12,720 --> 00:59:13,790
you have no manners.

848
00:59:14,890 --> 00:59:15,890
Sorry.

849
00:59:16,720 --> 00:59:17,730
I am sorry.

850
00:59:21,400 --> 00:59:24,870
Tae Bong might talk like that, but he usually treats Hong Du...

851
00:59:25,500 --> 00:59:28,070
He cares for her so much, Chairman. Yes.

852
00:59:29,070 --> 00:59:31,370
- I do? - You do.

853
00:59:34,140 --> 00:59:35,980
But sir, no...

854
00:59:37,650 --> 00:59:40,480
Chairman, I did not know you were a fan of Tae Bong.

855
00:59:41,420 --> 00:59:43,480
Then is the reason you invited us today...

856
00:59:47,020 --> 00:59:48,220
Because I wanted to see you in person.

857
00:59:49,960 --> 00:59:51,290
Who?

858
01:00:06,040 --> 01:00:07,810
Hey, Cha Hong Du, give me some of this.

859
01:00:08,210 --> 01:00:10,240
Su Dong, you can eat later.

860
01:00:13,010 --> 01:00:14,020
Eat this too.

861
01:00:16,650 --> 01:00:18,990
- That too. - Seriously.

862
01:00:22,660 --> 01:00:24,790
- Eat it all. - Nice.

863
01:00:27,400 --> 01:00:29,100
Where did it go? I was going to eat this.

864
01:00:29,460 --> 01:00:30,500
You eat that.

865
01:00:35,570 --> 01:00:37,470
I could die right now and have no regrets.

866
01:00:39,270 --> 01:00:41,240
Your button popped off.

867
01:00:41,940 --> 01:00:43,080
I am full.

868
01:00:44,250 --> 01:00:46,550
Chairman, if it is not an intrusion,

869
01:00:46,610 --> 01:00:49,080
would it be okay if I took a look around the house?

870
01:00:49,320 --> 01:00:51,050
I want to take your taste to heart...

871
01:00:51,390 --> 01:00:53,250
and use it as nourishment for my life.

872
01:00:54,620 --> 01:00:56,420
- Yes, go ahead. - Then I will join you.

873
01:00:56,490 --> 01:00:57,490
Yes. Secretary Kim.

874
01:00:57,890 --> 01:00:58,890
Yes.

875
01:00:59,290 --> 01:01:01,460
- Yes, I will show you around. - Yes, thank you.

876
01:01:01,860 --> 01:01:02,860
Wow.

877
01:01:04,000 --> 01:01:05,200
Do you have a helicopter here?

878
01:01:06,130 --> 01:01:07,340
Then let us start with the roof.

879
01:01:07,670 --> 01:01:09,900
Before dessert comes out, I am going to go to the restroom.

880
01:01:34,630 --> 01:01:38,200
I hear celebrities date all sorts of people.

881
01:01:40,130 --> 01:01:41,870
Whether they are a celebrity or not,

882
01:01:42,200 --> 01:01:44,640
when it comes to meeting people, putting a different frame on it...

883
01:01:45,740 --> 01:01:46,740
is a prejudice.

884
01:01:51,380 --> 01:01:54,450
From what I heard, you have had quite a few dating rumours.

885
01:01:55,120 --> 01:01:56,120
Well...

886
01:01:56,950 --> 01:01:57,990
It is a measure of popularity.

887
01:01:59,850 --> 01:02:01,420
What about your relationship with your agency staff?

888
01:02:01,690 --> 01:02:03,720
- Do you get along well? - Excuse me?

889
01:02:03,790 --> 01:02:05,730
Are you confident you will not hurt her?

890
01:02:05,790 --> 01:02:07,830
I am asking if you can keep her smiling.

891
01:02:09,260 --> 01:02:11,170
What do you...

892
01:02:18,270 --> 01:02:19,270
No, what I mean is...

893
01:02:20,880 --> 01:02:23,240
Because of our group's image,

894
01:02:23,310 --> 01:02:24,850
I want you to always set a good example.

895
01:02:28,050 --> 01:02:29,050
Eat up.

896
01:02:42,300 --> 01:02:43,430
Take it to your grave.

897
01:02:52,070 --> 01:02:53,670
What was that again?

898
01:02:59,850 --> 01:03:01,150
You cannot go in that room.

899
01:03:01,650 --> 01:03:02,880
That is the Chairman's study.

900
01:03:04,220 --> 01:03:05,220
Oh my goodness.

901
01:03:05,990 --> 01:03:07,760
You look unbelievably similar.

902
01:03:08,320 --> 01:03:10,460
- Excuse me? - We have a ghost.

903
01:03:10,530 --> 01:03:13,590
I do not mean a real ghost. The young lady of this house.

904
01:03:13,960 --> 01:03:16,030
She went somewhere for now, though.

905
01:03:17,900 --> 01:03:20,300
Do I look that much like that person?

906
01:03:21,870 --> 01:03:24,170
- Do you still have room for that? - Yes.

907
01:03:24,740 --> 01:03:26,410
Hey, I am just forcing it in.

908
01:03:26,470 --> 01:03:28,040
There is a separate stomach for dessert.

909
01:03:28,110 --> 01:03:29,180
What? You just do not know.

910
01:03:29,710 --> 01:03:30,710
Please, enjoy.

911
01:03:31,550 --> 01:03:33,450
It is a specially flown-in cake, so it should be very delicious.

912
01:03:33,510 --> 01:03:35,320
Yes, Chairman, it is really delicious.

913
01:03:36,320 --> 01:03:37,320
Why are you not eat...

914
01:03:38,920 --> 01:03:41,920
Why is Hong Du taking so long?

915
01:03:41,920 --> 01:03:43,360
Because this house is so big,

916
01:03:43,420 --> 01:03:46,730
she must have gotten lost, right? I will go and...

917
01:03:47,760 --> 01:03:49,460
No, I will go get her.

918
01:03:50,200 --> 01:03:51,200
Keep eating.

919
01:03:57,510 --> 01:03:58,510
Is it over there?

920
01:04:52,190 --> 01:04:53,190
I am sure...

921
01:04:55,660 --> 01:04:56,860
it is someone I know...

922
01:05:31,970 --> 01:05:33,030
It is all your fault.

923
01:05:33,700 --> 01:05:34,970
I said it is all your fault.

924
01:06:24,620 --> 01:06:26,190
What is seriously wrong with me?

925
01:06:46,470 --> 01:06:47,880
At Tae Bong's house, too...

926
01:06:48,880 --> 01:06:51,180
There was a girl who looked exactly like you.

927
01:07:05,860 --> 01:07:06,860
This is Han Jung Woo.

928
01:07:07,230 --> 01:07:09,930
The woman who is currently with Tae Bong...

929
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:13,070
Please tell me.

930
01:07:15,070 --> 01:07:16,170
Is Cha Hong Du...

931
01:07:22,810 --> 01:07:24,040
really Oh Hae Ra?

932
01:07:27,110 --> 01:07:28,120
Do not touch that!

933
01:07:32,320 --> 01:07:33,350
You startled me.

934
01:07:56,780 --> 01:07:58,810
(Oh! My Guard)
